# Dependencies
# Match both real directories and symlink form. Worktrees from /backlog-next
# symlink the top-level node_modules to the main checkout; `node_modules/`
# alone misses the symlink and leaves it as an untracked entry.
node_modules
package-lock.json

# Build outputs
dist/
tmp/
tmp-*/
.nx/
node-compile-cache/
nx-native-file-cache-*/
v8-compile-cache-*/

# Stray empty `handlers/` dir at repo root — leaked by a CDK synth/test path
# whose serviceDir defaults to process.cwd() (egress.test.ts uses os.tmpdir()
# correctly; the actual leaker is unknown). Filed as parking:
# handlers-dir-leak-at-repo-root.
handlers/

# Nx daemon CWD-fallback socket dirs — leaked when nx-console wipes the OS
# temp area and the daemon falls back to repo root (tmp-dir.js:51-55).
# Each LOCK_FILES_CHANGED restart leaves an empty <20-hex>/ behind. See
# docs/backlog/backlog-next-closing-phase-friction.md § A.2.
[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]/

